            "review_title": "Review at Sen Sen - Vietnamese Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Pilza\nDüsseldorf, Germany122 contributions\n0\nThe Asian place around the corner\nMay 2026 • Couples\nThis little Asian restaurant must be discovered. It is in a neighborhood off the beaten path, more of a neighborhood oasis. There are Vietnamese, Japanese, and Thai dishes. Everything is prepared very fresh and according to your wishes with more or less lemongrass, spiciness, coriander....\nThose who are unsure will be lovingly and attentively advised. The cocktails are also very delicious. \nThe atmosphere is calm and stylish. A place for a spontaneous evening with neighbors or friends, or even for healthy cuisine at lunchtime.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten May 12, 2026",
